          "text": "A 2D anime fighting game character idle animation, like a Street Fighter or Guilty Gear idle loop. The athletic adult female former-naval shield warrior Hibi keeps the exact same right-facing wide planted defensive stance. She has short charcoal hair with one silver-white fore-temple streak, stern gray eyes, a short dark navy brass-trimmed naval jacket, rolled ivory sleeves, brown leather and steel partial armor, dark trousers, a burgundy waist sash and heavy buckled steel-toed brown boots. Her left forearm stays braced BEHIND the one enormous broken oval mirror shield on screen right, guarding her shoulder, chest and abdomen. Her right arm stays freely extended to screen left with the same open gloved hand. Like a heavyweight fighting game shield fighter, she repeats a steady measured rhythmic guard-breathing cycle in place: her bent knees clearly flex and straighten, her hips and chest sink and rise together, and her shoulders and shield-bearing forearm settle and recover as one connected body supporting a heavy shield. She keeps the original forward defensive lean, chin lifted and eyes on the opponent; her head and neck follow her torso without nodding. Her free right arm and open hand follow the breathing without waving or grabbing the shield. Repeat the same planted guard cycle several times, never attacking or changing the stance. Both feet stay flat on the ground in exactly the same spots; she never jumps and never steps. Her body keeps facing right and does not turn toward the camera. Her short hair tips and tattered navy, ivory and burgundy cloth softly follow through with the breathing and settle. The huge mirror shield stays in exactly the same guarding orientation in front of her body, moving only with the braced arm and shoulder. The oval metal rim stays straight, rigid and constant in shape and size; mirror panels, cracks, holes, straps and rivets remain fixed to that same rigid shield. No shield bash, no shield swing, no second hand touching the rim, no floating shards, no sparks, no fire, no glow. Same face, same costume, same colors. Fixed camera, no zoom, full body always visible, flat plain green background."
